I sit in front of my laptop.
I have a pen and paper.
I play the cooking video.
First, I listen carefully.
The chef tells the ingredients.
"Write down the exact quantities," he says.
I write the first ingredient.
"Take half a kilo of thick poha," the chef says.
I write 'half a kilo of poha' on the paper.
Then, he tells about the onions.
"Take a quarter kilo of onions."
I write that down.
"Take some peanuts too," he says.
After that, I write 'some peanuts'.
We also need some basic spices.
The chef says, "Add two spoons of oil and some mustard seeds."
I check my kitchen cabinet.
I already have oil and mustard seeds.
Finally, he mentions green chilies and lemon.
My shopping list is now complete.
I put the list in my bag.
Now I am ready to go to the shop.
